{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13429","headline":"登栖霞寺 · 常衮","name":"登栖霞寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林香雨气新，山寺绿无尘。\n遂结云外侣，共游天上春。\n鹤鸣金阁丽，僧语竹房邻。\n待月水流急，惜花风起频。\n何方非坏境，此地有归人。\n回首空门外，皤然一幻身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}